ne;clear:both;color:rgb(36,39,41)\">but this time for stopping the App and not running it.</p><p style=\"font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;font-size:15px;line-height:inherit;font-family:Arial,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,sans-serif;vertical-align:baseline;clear:both;color:rgb(36,39,41)\"><br></p><p style=\"font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;font-size:15px;line-height:inherit;font-family:Arial,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,sans-serif;vertical-align:baseline;clear:both;color:rgb(36,39,41)\"><br></p><p style=\"font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;font-size:15px;line-height:inherit;font-family:Arial,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,sans-serif;vertical-align:baseline;clear:both;color:rgb(36,39,41)\">Appreciate your help !</p></div></div>"
